# Frontend build-time env (Vite). Copy to frontend/.env for local dev.
#
# The Google OAuth *client id* (public; safe to ship in the bundle). When set, the
# "Sign in with Google" button renders the real Google Identity Services flow; when
# absent, the UI falls back to the keyless stub sign-in (AUTH_VERIFIER=stub backend).
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
